Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You are standing in an open field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The air smells like metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your hair… starts to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three hundred million volts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In a split second, the air around you heats to thirty thousand degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Five times hotter than the surface of the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The rain on your skin turns to steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:31.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your shoes can be blown right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And your heart… stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:43.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But often, most of the current flashes over your skin, not through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It leaves a strange mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A red, fern-like pattern, called a Lichtenberg figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}With fast help, nine out of ten people survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One park ranger was struck seven times… and lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:08.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}If you can hear thunder… you are close enough to be struck.
